; The open-wheelers' stock racing slick, the only class on RACE. Factors over the all-season tyre, all estimates: no tread to clear water or bite loose ground (wet 0.5, snow 0.4, ice 0.6, gravel and dirt 0.85, grass and sand 0.7, mud and field 0.6).

